# Editors gate every file that can decide what CODE a job runs: the workflows and the composite
# action, this file, and paper-environment.yml (installing a package runs its hooks, in the same
# job as the tokens). The paper's own content is not gated, and neither is myst.yml, so an author
# still moves their paper to a newer engine on their own.
# Why these files and not others: https://scholar.nexus/oaktree-sapling/design/paper-ci
#
# The owner is replaced at bootstrap. A personal-account repo has no org team so it names a user;
# an org tenant uses a team like @your-org/editors.
/.github/                @pollomarzo
/CODEOWNERS              @pollomarzo
/paper-environment.yml   @pollomarzo
